%% Sequence of run 20261015-171638: UC1 calibration on the REAL camera (covered), 5 orchestrator decisions.
%% Every orchestrator decision and every hw_decide is one model call (not drawn).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as person (CLI)
    participant O as orchestrator
    participant D as hw_decide<br/>(executor model)
    participant A as hw_approve
    participant W as hw_call
    participant S as MCP server evcam<br/>(stdio)
    participant C as event camera<br/>(IMX636, covered)

    P->>O: task uc1_calibration.md

    Note over O: decision 1: hardware, "find_hot_pixels"
    O->>D: instruction
    D->>W: find_hot_pixels({"seconds": 0.5, "top": 64, "min_rate_hz": 20000}) (measurement)
    W->>S: tools/call find_hot_pixels
    S->>C: open + 8 s settle (first use), 0.5 s recording (not saved)
    C-->>S: events
    S-->>W: hot pixels (926, 151) and (1053, 704), 4.47 MHz each
    W-->>O: hardware turn (call + result verbatim)

    Note over O: decision 2: hardware, mask the 2 pixels
    O->>D: instruction
    D->>A: mask_pixels({"pixels": [{"x": 926, "y": 151}, {"x": 1053, "y": 704}]})
    A->>P: interrupt: approve this camera call?
    P-->>A: yes
    A->>W: approved
    W->>S: tools/call mask_pixels
    S-->>W: refused by the schema: pixels must be [x, y] pairs (ok: false)
    W-->>O: hardware turn with the error

    Note over O: decision 3: hardware, mask_pixels with [x, y] pairs
    O->>D: instruction
    D->>A: mask_pixels({"pixels": [[926, 151], [1053, 704]]})
    A->>P: interrupt: approve this camera call?
    P-->>A: yes
    A->>W: approved
    W->>S: tools/call mask_pixels
    S->>C: digital event mask, 2 slots
    S-->>W: ok, slots_used 2
    W-->>O: hardware turn

    Note over O: decision 4: hardware, "record 2 seconds"
    O->>D: instruction
    D->>W: record({"seconds": 2})
    W->>S: tools/call record
    S->>C: stream 2 s
    C-->>S: 2,755 events
    S-->>W: ok, 0.001378 Mev/s, no warning
    W-->>O: hardware turn

    Note over O: decision 5: human, kind hard, proposed_next finish
    O->>P: human stop: "Shall I finish and report this noise level?" (1377.5 events per second)
    P-->>O: yes → END (stop reason: finish)
